{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721600/extras/about_this_game_ENG.gif?t=1747413947\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Monster Chef demo is served!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>Pranzo</strong>, a fearless chef-warrior who battles cute yet fierce monsters and cooks them right on the battlefield using their <strong>Chef Weapons</strong>. In this demo, you'll venture into the <strong>Fresche Frasche</strong> woods, rebuild your <strong>Inn</strong>, make new friends, and face the fearsome <strong>Modoro</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's included in this DEMO:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One playable area</strong>: <i>Fresche Frasche Woods</i>, with procedurally generated maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One boss fight</strong>: <i>Modoro</i>, a fearsome giant tomato</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time combat &amp; cooking system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic inn management features</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Saving is enabled</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full controller and keyboard support</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721600/extras/MODORO_STEAM.gif?t=1747413947\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo version. Features like additional areas, more bosses, advanced inn upgrades, more recipes, and expanded combat mechanics are part of the full game and not available in this demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Languages fully supported in the demo (interface and subtitles):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>English, Italian, French, German, Spanish (Spain), Chinese (Simplified), Japanese,